  "schema": "varcamp-native-pixel-woka-design-v3",
  "source": "Original hand-authored native 32px RPG pixel sprites. Every pixel comes from ASCII templates in tools/wokas/pixel-v3.ts resolved through the palettes below; stock WorkAdventure characters were viewed only as a proportion/shading reference and no pixels were copied, traced or composited.",
